    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/extras/e2a8604c999cf2dd73f38a16d67d8418.avif?t=1752513714\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage Room Catharsis: The Most Enjoyable Way to Release Stress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever felt tense at the end of a long day? Rage Room Catharsis is designed precisely for those moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological research shows that physical expression in a safe and controlled environment can lower stress levels, support mental balance, and promote emotional relief. The ancient practice of catharsis now meets the immersive power of virtual reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How Does It Work?</strong><br>While playing, your body naturally:<br>\u2022 Reduces stress hormone levels<br>\u2022 Releases endorphins (your \u201chappy hormones\u201d)<br>\u2022 Relieves muscle tension<br>\u2022 Calms your mind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, when you put on your VR headset, you\u2019re not just playing\u2014you\u2019re rebalancing your nervous system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Rage Room Catharsis?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Smash the Unsmasheable</strong><br>Shatter expensive vases, giant TVs, and office chairs\u2014do the impossible in VR, safely and guilt-free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Choose Your Weapon</strong><br>Sledgehammer, baseball bat, handgun, laser sword\u2014whatever fits your stress relief style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Slow Motion Mode</strong><br>Feel every hit in cinematic slow motion. Watch debris fly and tension melt away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Diverse Environments</strong><br>Not just a room! Explore metro stations, space bases, industrial labs, and more to match your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Two Gameplay Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Challenge Mode</strong><br>Destroy specified targets within a time limit. Fast-paced gameplay that tests your focus and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Free Mode</strong><br>No rules. No time pressure. Just break, smash, and release as you wish\u2014perfect for emotional catharsis and deep relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Result?</strong><br>By the end of the session, you won\u2019t just have broken objects\u2014you\u2019ll have broken free.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 Let Rage Room Catharsis absorb your stress in VR, and return to the real world calmer, lighter, and renewed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/extras/484c969ae6c24aca1de063950bb6bd03.avif?t=1752513714\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
