labs, and more to match your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Two Gameplay Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Challenge Mode</strong><br>Destroy specified targets within a time limit. Fast-paced gameplay that tests your focus and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Free Mode</strong><br>No rules. No time pressure. Just break, smash, and release as you wish\u2014perfect for emotional catharsis and deep relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Result?</strong><br>By the end of the session, you won\u2019t just have broken objects\u2014you\u2019ll have broken free.<br>\ud83c\udfa7 Let Rage Room Catharsis absorb your stress in VR, and return to the real world calmer, lighter, and renewed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582470/extras/484c969ae6c24aca1de063950bb6bd03.avif?t=1752513714\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
